Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:22.34,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Sekarang, mereka bertiga\Nakan bersembunyi di sekitar sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.38,main,PANDOROBO,0,0,0,,Siapa yang paling sering muncul?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:32.14,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Di mana mereka?\NDi mana mereka?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.43,main,PANDOROBO,0,0,0,,Di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.23,0:07:42.07,italics,PANDOROBO,0,0,0,,Jurus langkah kilat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:08.44,signtext,パンどろぼうたち でてきたかいすう,0,0,0,,{\c&H06122F&\fnBack Nature\fs25\an7\pos(39.34,51.33)}Jumlah Kemunculan Pencuri Roti dan Kawan-kawannya
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:08.44,signtext,パンどろぼう,0,0,0,,{\c&H06122F&\fnBack Nature\fs25\an7\pos(46.01,120.66)}Pencuri Roti
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:08.44,signtext,こうさぎ,0,0,0,,{\c&H06122F&\fnBack Nature\fs25\an7\pos(46.01,204.66)}Kousagi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:08:08.44,signtext,こぐま,0,0,0,,{\c&H06122F&\fnBack Nature\fs25\an7\pos(46.01,286.66)}Koguma
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:04.34,main,PANDOROBO,0,0,0,,Aku yang paling sering muncul hari ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.34,0:08:06.13,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Hebat sekali, Pencuri Roti!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:08.09,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Ayo main lagi!
